## 4. Proposed Tooling Stack for Milestone 1 (Proposals Pending Approval)

| Tool / Library | Proposed Role | Status | Justification / Notes |
|:---|:---|:---:|:---|
| **Python 3.11 / 3.13** | Core Programming Language | Proposal Pending Approval | Python 3.13.2 verified present on host OS. |
| **NumPy (>= 1.25)** | Vectorized math, arrays, PCG64 Generator | Proposal Pending Approval | Essential for vectorized path simulation and `SeedSequence`. |
| **SciPy (>= 1.11)** | Special functions, analytical moments, erf | Proposal Pending Approval | Minimal math utilities (no optimization needed in M1). |
| **pytest (>= 7.4)** | Test runner, FAST/SLOW markers | Proposal Pending Approval | Standard test framework for CI/CD assertions. |
| **matplotlib (optional)** | Convergence figure export | Proposal Pending Approval | Headless PNG plot export for evidence artifacts. |
| **Pydantic** | Configuration validation | **EXCLUDED FROM M1** | Unnecessary dependency for Milestone 1; standard library dict/json proposed. |
| **PyTorch** | Tensor compute, autograd | **EXCLUDED FROM M1** | Unnecessary for Milestone 1; deferred to deep learning phase. |
| **CVXPY** | Convex optimization | **EXCLUDED FROM M1** | Unnecessary for Milestone 1; deferred to Phase 5. |
